:::text id=Hq5tyvbKvt at=top-center width=86% height=144 preset=title align=center
# How We Connect — Communication Preferences & Rules
:::

:::shape id=Vpo6jtC3I4 at=center width=480 height=424 offsetX=-256 offsetY=80 kind=rect fill=surface borderRadius=16
:::

:::text id=khe44S3pM1 at=center width=424 height=64 offsetX=-256 offsetY=-80 preset=caption align=center color=#06B6D4
PREFERRED CHANNELS & BOUNDARIES
:::

:::text id=VnIHUGWqKk at=center width=424 height=312 offsetX=-256 offsetY=104 preset=body align=left color=text
- **Slack/Teams** (Chat): Best for non-mentally taxing and quick info exchange.
- **Face-to-Face or Call**: Best for complex or easily misunderstood topics.
- **Email**: Best for official decisions or third-party communications.
- **Context upfront**: Context provided upfront unless mutual understanding is established.
- **One at a time**: Only handle one face-to-face or live call conversation at a time.
:::

:::shape id=Gd-emq4NLM at=center width=480 height=424 offsetX=264 offsetY=80 kind=rect fill=surface borderRadius=16
:::

:::text id=Zo0pYXOIvk at=center width=424 height=64 offsetX=264 offsetY=-80 preset=caption align=center color=#166534
STANDARD 3-STEP FORMAT
:::

:::text id=puoTqy2qXA at=center width=424 height=272 offsetX=264 offsetY=104 preset=body align=left color=text
- **1. Context (facts only)**: State background and factual basis clearly.
- **2. Problem definition**: Clearly define the exact problem being addressed.
- **3. Proposed solutions**: Present actionable recommendations or options (if any).
:::
